    "One row per RONE product that ships as AAX (Pro Tools). Read by build-aax.ps1, sign-aax.ps1 and RONE_AAX.iss.",
    "folder  = the plugin's folder in the monorepo (a submodule, or vendored files).",
    "target  = the juce_add_plugin target; the AAX build target is <target>_AAX.",
    "bundle  = PRODUCT_NAME, i.e. the file name '<bundle>.aaxplugin'.",
    "category = JUCE AAX_CATEGORY (Pro Tools' plug-in menu).",
    "wcguid  = PACE wrap configuration GUID for this product, created in PACE Central",
    "          (DEVELOPER > Products). Empty until then; sign-aax.ps1 refuses to sign a row without one.",
    "formats_line = 'bridge' only for the Analyzer, whose formats come from a variable."
